OL,3,ACeasefire allows evacuation from
OL,4,Adevastated Russian-occupied Oleshky
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of residents of the devastated
OL,7,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,8,Fbeen evacuated, Russian and Ukrainian
OL,9,Fauthorities have said, following a
OL,10,Fhumanitarian ceasefire brokered by US
OL,11,FFirst Lady Melania Trump.
OL,13,F"Everything unfolded without any
OL,14,Fincidents, and both sides noted the
OL,15,Fhigh level of organisation," Russia's
OL,16,Fhuman rights ombudsman Yana Lantratova
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FUkrainian authorities confirmed the
OL,20,Fevacuees were on their way to southern
OL,21,FRussia, from where they will travel on
OL,22,Fto Ukraine through Belarus.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
