OL,3,ACeasefire allows evacuation from
OL,4,Adevastated Russian-occupied Oleshky
OL,5,
OL,6,FMelania Trump said that "all elements
OL,7,Fof the convoy, including the safe
OL,8,Fpassageway in and out of Oleshky, was
OL,9,Festablished through mutual agreement
OL,10,Fbetween Russian and Ukrainian leaders".
